<title>FINLAND: TABLE - Finland Bank reserves up FIM 2.1 bln in week.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Finland Bank reserves up FIM 2.1 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to July 23 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to July 15.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 64,019	61,899</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,575	 8,921</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,921	 1,921</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,908	 1,908</p>
<p> Other				 7,899	 8,160</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,322	82,809</p>
<p>In the week to July 15, reserves rose by 1.6 billion markka ($295.7 million).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
<p>($ = 5.410 Finnish Markka)</p>
